    "Name": "Alke MBT",
    "Details": "Conceived as a heavy MBT, the 75 ton Alke was designed to operate as part of a combined arms Nova. Powered by a 300 rated engine, the OmniTank can reach speeds of 60kph whilst carrying 12 tons of armour; with 33.5 tons of podspace for various configurations. Mostly found in the Hell's Horses Touman, only the Coyotes have adopted the Alke; using it to replace their older Mars tanks. The Alke Prime configuration is armed with an ER PPC and a UAC/10. For closer ranges it carries a pair of Streak SRM-6's and 4 Machine Guns.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       300     40\n<b>Left</b>         240     40\n<b>Right</b>       240     40\n<b>Rear</b>        195     40\n<b>Turret</b>      230     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      1205    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
